/scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824328_2646454269158231_1132767346869252557_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jWI6KvyGkgYQ7kNvwEnUhv5&_nc_oc=AdrY7DerSftSBGZr0k5e1eK_zyQPH4ZnTMf24fBWcePNOx7s9X8IU7aLv5UOX4brAUc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRbeKZu9B49CPZQ8i8Arx4mzSoDx40FlxvC-bTAmuO0pA&oe=6B0DB0B1"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "29597469706511727", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_29597469726511725_5531021007265127409_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S2mxeVXSjwoQ7kNvwFMP6B5&_nc_oc=AdrFwaEsW-puvQd_SgcekuUzbEhjh9UVonrPj9chTkGvGW8DZOgDgZ3QTtfT5dHN2oY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQR4qTh3cYdbyhhW9qJy1GXTwYPy5ke0KYfS0n3q5bD9YQ&oe=6B0DB67A"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1663370398752469", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824665_1663370405419135_7145113897709593890_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bxumryYXLU0Q7kNvwGKEU-a&_nc_oc=Adq4vYSA_8i0u30GuN1gWTa_wERu9OEJn3yFaVX6jDAbcYH8unDgJ3LwYTcwRejkHCQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRE6CcVkYtzZ2xyRuMfmGU1BV9pnffxQTjuFeUXdvRdbg&oe=6B0DD2BD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "I Am Gangster", "keywords": ["gangster", "gangsterSimulator", "PoliceChase", "CityGangster"], "long_description": "Gangster step into I Am Gangster, a VR gangster simulator where crime missions, police chases, car driving, and sandbox action collide. Break the rules, cause chaos, or take a break from the action the gangster life is yours to explore.\n\nTake on different gangster missions and discover new things to do. Drive cars, ride motorcycles, snatch vehicles, race through the streets, and run from the police. Turn every escape into a fast-paced police chase in this crime-themed VR adventure.\n\nChoose from different weapons and jump into action. Grab and throw NPCs, fire a rocket launcher to destroy a helicopter, and experiment with hands-on interactions. When the excitement slows down, party at the nightclub, head home to sleep, or go out for another ride.\n\nKEY FEATURES\n\u2022 Different gangster missions and activities\n\u2022 VR gangster simulator and crime sandbox gameplay\n\u2022 Car driving and motorcycle riding\n\u2022 Vehicle snatching and police escapes\n\u2022 Different weapons and rocket launcher action\n\u2022 Helicopter destruction challenges\n\u2022 Grab and throw NPCs\n\u2022 Fast running and interactive streets\n\u2022 Nightclub parties and home activities\n\u2022 Freedom to explore, drive, and cause chaos\n\nIf you enjoy gangster games, crime simulator games, police chase action, driving simulators, motorcycle games, weapon-based action, or VR sandbox adventures, I Am Gangster brings them together in one playful experience.\n\nChoose a mission, grab your keys, watch out for the police, and live your gangster adventure.", "short_description": "Become the gangster in I Am Gangster, a VR gangster simulator packed with crime missions, police chases, car driving, and sandbox action. Complete different gangster missions, drive cars and bikes, take vehicles, escape the police, and try a variety of weapons. Launch rockets at a helicopter, grab and throw NPCs, party at the club, or relax at home. Explore a wild VR crime game with driving, action, and gangster adventures."}]}, "developer_name": "Rebel Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rebelsgamestudio/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rebel Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rebelsgamestudio", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "199010